,"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist. Has handsome looks, and as such he is popular among the girls. He's a boy who understands the feelings of people and always ready to help them. He's usually joking and playing with others, but has good science knowledge. By chance, he succeeds in his development of an artificial intelligence – \"Apeiria.\""}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c59698"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作の主人公。変態。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格も、下半身もイケメン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人の気持ちのわかる少年で、人の気持ちいいところまでわかる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"考えることが得意で、特に下半身で考えることは得意中の得意。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段は冗談ばかりを言っているためしばしば誤解されることもあるが、意外に科学知識は豊富で、性知識も豊富。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常識に囚われない柔軟な発想の持ち主で、なんでもエロにつなげることができる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とはいえ、いざとなったら男らしく、やるときはしっかりやる性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自我と感情を持つ人工知能を作ろうと、日々しょうもない実験に勤しんでいる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16659","sourceWorkId":"24991","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作の主人公。変態。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格も、下半身もイケメン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人の気持ちのわかる少年で、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人の気持ちいいところまでわかる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"考えることが得意で、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特に下半身で考えることは"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"得意中の得意。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段は冗談ばかりを言っているため"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しばしば誤解されることもあるが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"意外に科学知識は豊富で、性知識も豊富。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常識に囚われない柔軟な発想の持ち主で、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なんでもエロにつなげることができる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とはいえ、いざとなったら男らしく、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"やるときはしっかりやる性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自我と感情を持つ人工知能を作ろうと、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日々しょうもない実験に勤しんでいる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"57514"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/20/20d5c0a2bb4a0ee97b56c32de95abea0a853157d6a5a879fe74eaa1ea72cc0c9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/75/750b4c3bca917a95ffd5344fd45e4083ee79caceebc35c25fdf902220a8a568d.webp","width":162,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"古河徹人","creatorId":"vndb:s299","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s299","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s299","name":"古河 徹人","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:210068:57514:6265:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c62393","characterName":"一 空観","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"57515","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"210068"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16750"],"vndbCharacterId":"c62393"},"originalCharacterName":"一 空観","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kuon's father. The developer of VRMMO \"Boundary\". A prominent AI researcher."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"An AI of First,"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"who aims to create a strong AI. According to his theory, after that, a technological singularity will occur, and humans will be forced to adapt by transforming themselves into AIs. And so, they would be able to change their bodies and personalities and copy themselves as they like. This revolution is his ideal."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Due to his wise Towako dying, he is trying to complete Thinker System, transfer her brain functions and specifics to a strong AI via it and make her live in VRMMO, thus making his wife's swampman. He believes smampmen are the same as the originals, just with different bodies. In one timeline, Kuugan has succeed to finish Thinker System in Second. As the result of test of the system, his swampman Bookman was created."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c62393"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"久遠の父親。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人工知能研究の世界的権威にして、完全没入型VRMMO【バウンダリー】の開発者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"メガネをかけると、妄想が止まらず、延々と危ない理論を喋り続ける。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16750","sourceWorkId":"24991","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"久遠の父親。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人工知能研究の世界的権威にして、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"完全没入型VRMMO【バウンダリー】の開発者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"メガネをかけると、妄想が止まらず、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"延々と危ない理論を喋り続ける。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"57515"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/aa/aaf0b3117de14e704146cd400c902245cf532b5d407f44fc97d6353db0638baa.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ae/ae0a3729e828046a398607ed34d86d59f2965ee71591cd7a5080ee94f8ffa6bc.webp","width":107,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"植木亨","creatorId":"vndb:s1257","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1257","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1257","name":"植木 亨","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:210068:57515:30465:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c62394","characterName":"シンカー","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"57518","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"210068"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16751"],"vndbCharacterId":"c62394"},"originalCharacterName":"シンカー","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A player in Second whose identity is unknown. Owner of a guild called Second Research Institute, also known as Institute (Kenkyuujo). He claims that his goal is to research Second and, ideally, to get control of part of it."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"There are two Thinkers, the first being the Thinker AI created by Ninomae Kuugan in First. This system then spawned an AI swampman based on Reiichi."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"His true desire is to save Apeiria from being deleted by the humans, preferably also taking out the original Reiichi along the way."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"He deceives the humans and their AI Server Control System by pretending to be only working towards the latter goal, while keeping them in the dark regarding his true goal of saving Apeiria. This way, he makes them think he is a useful asset against Reiichi and Apeiria. In truth, he was never the real antagonist nor the Observer; Thinker was simply biding his time for the opportunity to send Reiichi to the real world in order to save Apeiria, and hence throughout their mind games and confrontations tried to hint at the truth of the situation to him without the Observer catching on."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"While arguably an ally in the end, Thinker is also unabashed in admitting that if he could get rid of the original Reiichi and become Reiichi, he would not hesitate to do so - in the end though he admitted he simply could not compare to the original."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c62394"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"セカンドで出会う正体不明のプレイヤー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"研究所というギルドの所長。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16751","sourceWorkId":"24991","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"セカンドで出会う正体不明のプレイヤー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"研究所というギルドの所長。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"57518"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/71/717b8d762ea22c4fdc5efeda7a22c002696451ff9c0f350899ed820bf3161699.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b4/b44f349e278f104b0d90c15dbfe06d107bb74c78441c07e57b482c6795581deb.webp","width":145,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤井